Thoth is your God. You can check your allegiance and the names of the
Gods in the current games with CTRL-X. The phrase was "Go now, with
Thoth, and complete this quest before it is too late.", and it is merely
a religious flavour text.

>#3. What are the directions to the Tower of Darkness?

